 Musa (Moses) and his mission to guide Pharaoh and his people. The Surah emphasizes patience, faith, and trust in Allah while reminding believers of the importance of guidance, prayer, and humility.", "short_description": "Surah Ta-Ha highlights the story of Prophet Musa (Moses) and his mission to guide Pharaoh and his people. The Surah emphasizes patience, faith, and trust in Allah while reminding believers of the importance of guidance, prayer, and humility."}]}, "developer_name": "Miracle Group", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://miraclegroup.work/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Miracle Group", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.miraclegroup.work/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25920155227627128"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818860_939010232047260_4707047538473299976_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WuZ9mSQqj4sQ7kNvwHMYZYq&_nc_oc=AdqRsVg-MN8cG-gO6wW-nyrY_PSAiMueU5f2VHrEVL1MEHpITEqYq5jz_v5KkQc-j6I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSOaPU3DdpRDOBatSjIqKBv7aX443wYCK1NIaYaWYbm0Q&oe=6B045804"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "di